
Rige by: ['product'] dwaan: {
	>> total := 1.
	sels elk: { :index :element
		total fermannichfâldigje-mei: element.
	}. <- total.
}.

>> a := Rige ← 1 ; 2 ; 3.
Utfier skriuwe: a product, nije-rigel.
Utfier skriuwe: (Rige ← 2 ; 4 ; 8) product, nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (Rige ← -2 ; 10) product, nije-rigel. 
Utfier skriuwe: (Rige ← 0.5 ; -2) product, nije-rigel. 
